]:px-1.5 [&amp;_p_code]:align-middle [&amp;_p_code]:text-600 [&amp;_p_code]:font-500 [&amp;_p_code]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_p_code]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote]:[quotes:none] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:before:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_blockquote_p]:after:[content:&#39;&#39;] [&amp;_ul]:mt-3 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-4 [&amp;_.inline-next-element+*]:inline [&amp;_li_+_li]:pt-2 [&amp;&gt;div&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0"><div><p>Photoroom está diseñado especialmente para imágenes de e‑commerce y marcas. Nuestro eliminador de fondo con IA borra el fondo al instante y deja un fondo transparente que puedes cambiar por un fondo tipo estudio o de estilo de vida, si lo necesitas.</p></div></span></p></div></div></article><article><div class="group/faq-question flex cursor-pointer flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4 outline-none sm:py-6" role="button" aria-controls="faq-answer-_r_4_"><h4 class="heading-light-400 pt-[5px] [word-break:break-word] sm:heading-light-500 sm:pt-[3px]">¿Cómo funciona un removedor de fondo con IA?</h4><button type="button" class="relative inline-flex max-w-full appearance-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden truncate text-center outline-none duration-200 focus-visible:misc-border-size-focus-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-background-subdued text-content-primary hover:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:bg-background-subdued-hover focus-visible:ring-accent-alpha-5 active:bg-background-subdued-down rounded-500 disabled:opacity-30 h-8 w-8 shrink-0 rounded-full transition-all group-hover/faq-question:bg-background-subdued-hover" aria-busy="false"><div role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="flex items-center justify-center size-500"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-size-500" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M19 11H13V5C13 4.73478 12.8946 4.48043 12.7071 4.29289C12.5196 4.10536 12.2652 4 12 4C11.7348 4 11.4804 4.10536 